        {
            "title": "Another patch!",
            "date": "2024-08-19 16:41:08",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6909171012611380285",
            "notes": "Hey everyone, posting another patch! Thank you for reporting bugs in the discord.\n\n- Fixed spawnpoint being underground or in the air on multiplayer servers.\n- Make time not progress when you're in the escape menu in singleplayer.\n- The same key used to open a menu or crafting now also closes it.\n- Fixed settings sliders having obstructed names."
        },
        {
            "title": "0.2.1 Bug fix patch 1",
