            "notes": "- Added ability to paste into server address input.\n- Fixed meshing issue caused by blocks at y = 256.\n- Fixed problem with other players in multiplayer displaying with the wrong projection matrix."
        },
        {
            "title": "Update 0.2.1 Alpha Released",
            "date": "2024-08-17 14:05:59",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6909171012603698030",
            "notes": "[img]https://i.imgur.com/iKH76MN.png[/img]\nHello! As promised on the Discord, here is Alpha 0.2.1. It fixes many technical issues, addresses some user accessibility concerns, and provides the software for hosting your own server!\n\nTo host a server, go to the game's installed files after updating, and navigate to the \"server\" folder and launch voxelland-server.exe. You will be prompted to choose a port number, type it in and press Enter.\n\nEnjoy! More updates will be coming soon!\n"
        }
